{"id":"n16185-3-4","stage":3,"title":"감싸다 · 庇护","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16185-3-4-1","ko":"왜 자꾸 아이를 혼내고 그래.","zh":"怎么总是训孩子？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"아이를","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이를","audio":"/audio/8277639e49e2e994b4f7.mp3"}},{"text":"혼내고","meaning":"训斥，呵斥","explanation":"혼내다：训斥，呵斥；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"혼내다","audio":"/audio/fa90a800918fe3fb41d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87967","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼내고","audio":"/audio/58d6a887739beef606c2.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样做（指训斥孩子）","explanation":"그러다：那样做（指训斥孩子）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"